[Flatpak Repo]
Title=AI Extra
Url=https://first-storm.github.io/aiextra-flatpak/
Comment=ChatGPT Desktop and Claude Desktop, repackaged as Flatpaks
Description=Unofficial Flatpak repo for ChatGPT Desktop (OpenAI) and Claude Desktop (Anthropic). The actual proprietary app binaries are downloaded directly from OpenAI's and Anthropic's own servers at install time; this repo only ships the Flatpak wrapper and always points at the vendors' latest published build.
